### Send an email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/send HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

//{
//  "to": "1272369577@qq.com",
//  "subject": "Test email from HTTP Client",
//  "content": "This is a test email sent by the JetBrains HTTP Client."
//}

{
  "to": "holmesamzish86@outlook.com",
  "subject": "Test email from HTTP Client",
  "content": "This is a test email sent by the JetBrains HTTP Client."
}

### Send email with unicode content
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/send HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "cacc@arorms.cn",
  "subject": "Unicode test",
  "content": "This email contains unicode characters: 中文, 日本語, 한국어, 🎉"
}
